WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:32.125
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna described

2
00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:34.000
various paths of devotion.

3
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:34.750
In this verse,

4
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.208
He now, clarifying the relationship

5
00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:39.083
between karma-yoga and devotion,

6
00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:42.416
guides those seekers who, by actions

7
00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:43.375
and desires,

8
00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:44.208
because they are

9
00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:48.083
bound, cannot practise pure devotion.

10
00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:50.500
Here He explains the principle

11
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.458
of offering every action to the Lord.

12
00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:54.958
This verse specifically describes the stage

13
00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:58.458
of nishkam karma-yoga,

14
00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:02.625
which is the step before pure devotion.

15
00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:10.125
Lord Krishna explains in this verse

16
00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:12.833
that our every action, whether it is

17
00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:17.250
a daily duty, eating, giving charity,

18
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.916
or doing tapasya,

19
00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:22.166
all of it should be offered to Him.

20
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:24.875
This teaching is especially

21
00:01:24.875 --> 00:01:27.375
for practitioners of nishkam karma-yoga,

22
00:01:27.375 --> 00:01:29.291
who without attachment to fruits

23
00:01:29.291 --> 00:01:32.000
fulfil their duties.

24
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.500
By offering one's actions to Lord Krishna,

25
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:37.916
the seeker makes their work spiritual,

26
00:01:37.916 --> 00:01:38.708
and gradually

27
00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:40.500
they also let go of

28
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.708
ego-driven attachments.

29
00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:45.083
Even if this offering

30
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:47.625
is not made with complete devotion,

31
00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:50.250
it still purifies the heart

32
00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.375
and to connect with divine consciousness

33
00:01:52.375 --> 00:01:55.458
builds a bridge.

34
00:01:55.458 --> 00:01:57.833
Lord Krishna does not say explicitly

35
00:01:57.833 --> 00:01:59.000
that these offered

36
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:01.958
actions He accepts in the same way

37
00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:03.083
as He accepts

38
00:02:03.083 --> 00:02:05.125
pure devotion.

39
00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.041
Yet

40
00:02:06.041 --> 00:02:07.583
the principle of offering

41
00:02:07.583 --> 00:02:09.708
is itself elevating,

42
00:02:09.708 --> 00:02:12.125
because it redirects the seeker's life

43
00:02:12.125 --> 00:02:14.250
back toward the Lord.

44
00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.500
Through this verse,

45
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.333
Lord Krishna tells us that

46
00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:19.500
we should not abandon our duties,

47
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.791
but connect them with devotion,

48
00:02:21.791 --> 00:02:24.958
because when every action becomes surrender,

49
00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:26.125
then it frees us from

50
00:02:26.125 --> 00:02:28.500
the bondage of karma.

51
00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.750
Spiritual practice is not a separate activity,

52
00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.500
but the very life that becomes

53
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:37.916
when our every breath is offered to
Lord Krishna – that is true sadhana.

54
00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:45.416
Have you ever thought

55
00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:48.166
that whatever you have

56
00:02:48.166 --> 00:02:50.666
is all

57
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:52.833
My gift?

58
00:02:52.833 --> 00:02:55.916
Your every ability, every opportunity, your food –

59
00:02:55.916 --> 00:02:59.666
all of this flows from Me alone.

60
00:02:59.666 --> 00:03:03.125
Do you accept this truth?

61
00:03:03.125 --> 00:03:05.000
See,

62
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.916
gratitude is not just a feeling.

63
00:03:08.916 --> 00:03:12.166
It is, in every aspect of your life,

64
00:03:12.166 --> 00:03:16.250
the witness to My divine presence.

65
00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.958
When your work, your food,

66
00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:21.291
your struggles and victories – all of it

67
00:03:21.291 --> 00:03:26.250
you begin to offer to Me,

68
00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:29.875
then the way you see life

69
00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:31.583
changes.

70
00:03:31.583 --> 00:03:36.791
Your food is no longer just physical nourishment,

71
00:03:36.791 --> 00:03:40.916
but with Me a conversation,

72
00:03:40.916 --> 00:03:43.666
a sacred ritual.

73
00:03:43.666 --> 00:03:48.208
Work is no longer just personal achievement.

74
00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:52.125
It becomes a sweet path of service.

75
00:03:52.125 --> 00:03:56.166
Tend to the plants of your life's actions,

76
00:03:56.166 --> 00:03:58.041
nurture them,

77
00:03:58.041 --> 00:03:59.458
and their

78
00:03:59.458 --> 00:04:03.250
fruits offer to Me with reverence.

79
00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.750
When this feeling of gratitude

80
00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:09.958
awakens in your heart, then the smallest

81
00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:14.625
actions too will become full of meaning and joy,

82
00:04:14.625 --> 00:04:17.291
and this same gratitude

83
00:04:17.291 --> 00:04:20.750
will bring you closer to Me, because

84
00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:23.541
it will connect your heart, in your life,

85
00:04:23.541 --> 00:04:26.833
to My presence,

86
00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:31.250
and such offerings bring you deep peace

87
00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.791
and supreme joy.

88
00:04:34.791 --> 00:04:38.750
So let this be your daily practice.

89
00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.833
Live every moment

90
00:04:40.833 --> 00:04:42.916
as a humble offering,

91
00:04:42.916 --> 00:04:47.125
then in every moment of your life

92
00:04:47.125 --> 00:04:50.416
you will experience Me,

93
00:04:50.416 --> 00:04:52.833
and remember,

94
00:04:52.833 --> 00:04:55.708
surrender is the doorway

95
00:04:55.708 --> 00:04:58.541
to supreme liberation.

96
00:05:02.875 --> 00:05:06.458
A family is a vehicle

97
00:05:06.458 --> 00:05:11.333
that runs on the fuel of gratitude.

98
00:05:11.333 --> 00:05:14.041
I tell you

99
00:05:14.041 --> 00:05:17.166
that in your family life,

100
00:05:17.166 --> 00:05:19.875
the divine art of gratitude

101
00:05:19.875 --> 00:05:22.750
pass on to the next generation.

102
00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.208
Just as from one

103
00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:28.333
seed many seeds can grow,

104
00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:32.625
exactly in the same way, the seed
of gratitude in one heart

105
00:05:32.625 --> 00:05:36.000
by sowing gratitude in many hearts

106
00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.875
can create a whole garden.

107
00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:41.875
Help your family understand

108
00:05:41.875 --> 00:05:45.958
that happiness does not lie
in having more things,

109
00:05:45.958 --> 00:05:49.250
but with a heart full of gratitude,

110
00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.291
in using well

111
00:05:51.291 --> 00:05:55.375
what you already have.

112
00:05:55.375 --> 00:05:57.208
See,

113
00:05:57.208 --> 00:05:58.791
a family

114
00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:01.916
that has learned gratitude for the small

115
00:06:01.916 --> 00:06:06.416
joys around them,

116
00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:10.958
remains unbroken even in the
greatest adversity.

117
00:06:10.958 --> 00:06:15.416
Gratitude is that divine awareness

118
00:06:15.416 --> 00:06:17.708
which transforms even ordinary moments

119
00:06:17.708 --> 00:06:23.000
into extraordinary experiences.

120
00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:26.541
When spouses are grateful to each other,

121
00:06:26.541 --> 00:06:29.916
parents to their children,

122
00:06:29.916 --> 00:06:31.250
and children

123
00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:35.458
to their parents are grateful,

124
00:06:35.458 --> 00:06:39.250
then the home becomes heaven.

125
00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:42.041
But remember,

126
00:06:42.041 --> 00:06:46.000
spirituality, ritual, or responsibility

127
00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.250
should not feel like a burden.

128
00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.625
So

129
00:06:49.625 --> 00:06:53.125
help your children understand the feeling

130
00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:57.291
behind these practices.

131
00:06:57.291 --> 00:07:01.250
Explain to them that gratitude

132
00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.250
with Me

133
00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:07.166
is the very essence of forming a relationship.

134
00:07:07.166 --> 00:07:10.000
When they eat,

135
00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:13.083
let them feel that this

136
00:07:13.083 --> 00:07:15.625
is My blessing.

137
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:19.375
When they study or do any work,

138
00:07:19.375 --> 00:07:22.833
teach them to offer their efforts

139
00:07:22.833 --> 00:07:24.833
to Me.

140
00:07:24.833 --> 00:07:29.666
Just as blood flowing through the whole body

141
00:07:29.666 --> 00:07:33.208
ultimately returns to the heart,

142
00:07:33.208 --> 00:07:35.708
in the same way, all the feelings

143
00:07:35.708 --> 00:07:38.708
of a grateful family

144
00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:42.083
return to a pure, devotion-filled heart.

145
00:07:42.083 --> 00:07:45.750
The home that is filled with gratitude

146
00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:50.125
is filled with peace and joy.

147
00:07:50.125 --> 00:07:53.875
Whether it is food, help, or prayer,

148
00:07:53.875 --> 00:07:58.041
in every act let there be the feeling of gratitude.

149
00:07:58.041 --> 00:08:02.958
In this way, you will raise children

150
00:08:02.958 --> 00:08:05.958
who not toward material wealth,

151
00:08:05.958 --> 00:08:09.125
but through the heart,

152
00:08:09.125 --> 00:08:12.833
in connecting with Me through the simple

153
00:08:12.833 --> 00:08:17.791
yet profound path will find
life's supreme meaning,

154
00:08:17.791 --> 00:08:19.833
because

155
00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:21.541
gratitude is

156
00:08:21.541 --> 00:08:25.791
the foundation of true family happiness.

157
00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:35.333
I invite you

158
00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:38.166
to connect your professional life

159
00:08:38.166 --> 00:08:40.916
with Me.

160
00:08:40.916 --> 00:08:43.291
Whatever work you do,

161
00:08:43.291 --> 00:08:46.333
whatever decisions you take – them

162
00:08:46.333 --> 00:08:49.583
see as part of the Lord's work.

163
00:08:49.583 --> 00:08:50.333
When you

164
00:08:50.333 --> 00:08:53.583
look at your work this way,

165
00:08:53.583 --> 00:08:55.708
then it is no longer just a duty

166
00:08:55.708 --> 00:08:58.791
or a burden.

167
00:08:58.791 --> 00:09:01.875
It becomes a meaningful expression

168
00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:04.000
of your life's purpose.

169
00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.333
Working with this awareness,

170
00:09:07.333 --> 00:09:08.958
you will find

171
00:09:08.958 --> 00:09:11.000
that your efforts, however

172
00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:15.458
small they may be, to a vast divine

173
00:09:15.458 --> 00:09:19.583
plan are contributing.

174
00:09:19.583 --> 00:09:23.541
Your every-day tasks, like solving a problem,

175
00:09:23.541 --> 00:09:27.000
leading an organisation, completing a project,

176
00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:32.333
all become an act of service to the Lord.

177
00:09:32.333 --> 00:09:34.250
This perspective does not reduce

178
00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:39.291
your responsibilities, but elevates them.

179
00:09:39.291 --> 00:09:40.708
Remember,

180
00:09:40.708 --> 00:09:44.458
stress often arises

181
00:09:44.458 --> 00:09:48.708
when you feel alone,

182
00:09:48.708 --> 00:09:50.375
as if your work

183
00:09:50.375 --> 00:09:54.083
is cut off from your life's purpose.

184
00:09:54.083 --> 00:09:55.708
See,

185
00:09:55.708 --> 00:09:59.291
an engineer who just gets through the work

186
00:09:59.291 --> 00:10:01.583
becomes bored.

187
00:10:01.583 --> 00:10:03.666
But one who understands

188
00:10:03.666 --> 00:10:06.833
that he is solving society's problems

189
00:10:06.833 --> 00:10:09.375
remains full of enthusiasm.

190
00:10:09.375 --> 00:10:15.041
But when you work with the awareness

191
00:10:15.041 --> 00:10:16.250
that I

192
00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:19.750
am present in all your actions,

193
00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:23.625
then satisfaction enters your efforts.

194
00:10:23.625 --> 00:10:24.375
This divine

195
00:10:24.375 --> 00:10:28.791
connection transforms your
workplace into a centre of growth, service,

196
00:10:28.791 --> 00:10:33.416
and deep meaning.

197
00:10:33.416 --> 00:10:34.583
In this way, work

198
00:10:34.583 --> 00:10:38.416
is no longer only about results,

199
00:10:38.416 --> 00:10:40.541
but every day

200
00:10:40.541 --> 00:10:44.541
of living your purpose becomes the path.
